## Equations of different genotypes

Each genotype has its own equation, with coefficients estimated from the 31 trajectories of that genotype. The sparse models (STLSQ) of all genotypes, fitted to all years, give genotype-specific growth rates. Growth rate along the mean weather path, for every genotype (grey) and for the genotypes with the lowest, median and highest final biomass:

